        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Pierre Womé, Christian Poulsen, Herbert Fandel, Markus Rosenberg\n- Places: Cameroon, Denmark, Sweden\n- Events: Denmark v Sweden (UEFA Euro 2008 qualifying)\n- Roles: footballer, defender, referee, midfielder, striker, supporter\n\nFacts:\n- Pierre Nlend Womé was born on 26 March 1979 and is a Cameroonian retired footballer who played as a defender.\n- Christian Bjørnshøj Poulsen was born on 28 February 1980 and is a Danish former footballer.\n- In the Denmark v Sweden UEFA Euro 2008 qualifying match, referee Herbert Fandel awarded Sweden a penalty in the 89th minute and sent off Danish midfielder Christian Poulsen for punching Swedish striker Markus Rosenberg in the stomach.\n- In the same match, a Danish supporter ran onto the pitch and attacked referee Herbert Fandel.",
